  90:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  * but if they don't, it'll do something at least marginally useful.
  91:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  *
  92:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  * NOTE: to use the library in an environment that doesn't support the
  93:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  * C stdio library, you may have to delete the call to fprintf() entirely,
  94:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  * not just not use this routine.
  95:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  */
  96:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c **** 
