 120:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  *   -1: recoverable corrupt-data warning, may want to abort.
 121:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  *    0: important advisory messages (always display to user).
 122:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  *    1: first level of tracing detail.
 123:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  *    2,3,...: successively more detailed tracing messages.
 124:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  * An application might override this method if it wanted to abort on warnings
 125:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  * or change the policy about which messages to display.
 126:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jerror.c ****  */
